  "description": "CSS font-style values accepted by Canvas 2D. `'oblique'` slants an upright face by a fixed angle. Where a family ships a real italic the browser resolves `'italic'` to it and `'oblique'` to the synthesised slant; where it does not, both end up synthesised and look the same.",
